WEBVTT

00:18:29.796 --> 00:18:32.156
for what our future looks like.

00:18:32.156 --> 00:18:36.316
And so I just can't wait for them
to have full voice and full space

00:18:36.356 --> 00:18:39.916
to share those ideas
and make it become a reality.

00:18:39.916 --> 00:18:42.956
My work is women of color,
but work isn't working for anybody.

00:18:42.996 --> 00:18:45.476
Like, I use that line everywhere,

00:18:45.516 --> 00:18:48.076
and we need to remake work
so that it works for all.

00:18:48.116 --> 00:18:52.276
And I think if there was ever a time
to change it, not just for women of color,

00:18:52.276 --> 00:18:53.916
but for everybody, it's now.

00:18:53.916 --> 00:18:55.596
So I'm very optimistic.

00:18:56.276 --> 00:18:59.076
And I think that, you know,
I already see change happening.

00:18:59.116 --> 00:19:02.596
I think this feels like a prime moment
to undo some of the history,